#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The entry %s is hashed (inalterable) and therefore cannot be split."
msgstr ""
"Il movimento %s è con hash (inalterabile) e non può quindi essere diviso."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The entry %s is in a locked period and cannot be split."
msgstr ""
"Il movimento %s si trova in un periodo bloccato e non può essere diviso."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The entry %s would not be balanced after the split."
msgstr "Il movimento %s non sarebbe in pareggio dopo la divisione."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The entry has been modified in the meantime, please start again."
msgstr "Il movimento è stato modificato nel frattempo, ricominciare."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The item '%s' cannot absorb the amount to move."
msgstr "La riga '%s' non può assorbire l'importo da spostare."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The item '%s' cannot be used as a total item."
msgstr "La riga '%s' non può essere usata come riga del totale."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The item '%s' is linked to a payment or a bank statement and must be kept in"
" the current entry."
msgstr ""
"La riga '%s' è collegata a un pagamento o a un estratto conto e deve restare"
" nel movimento attuale."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The items to move are not balanced (difference of %s). Flag at least one "
"item (receivable, payable, ...) as 'Total' to share the difference between "
"both entries, or select balanced items."
msgstr ""
"Le righe da spostare non sono in pareggio (differenza di %s). Contrassegna "
"almeno una riga (credito, debito, ...) come 'Totale' per ripartire la "
"differenza tra i due movimenti, oppure seleziona righe in pareggio."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "The reconciled tax item '%s' cannot be split. Unreconcile it first."
msgstr ""
"La riga d'imposta riconciliata '%s' non può essere divisa. Annulla prima la "
"riconciliazione."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The reconciliation of '%s' generated exchange difference or cash basis "
"entries, which cannot be split automatically. Unreconcile it first."
msgstr ""
"La riconciliazione di '%s' ha generato movimenti di differenza cambio o di "
"imposte per cassa, che non possono essere divisi automaticamente. Annulla "
"prima la riconciliazione."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/models/ebics_file.py:0
msgid ""
"The statement for Account Number %(nr)s is imported in a background job."
msgstr ""
"L'estratto conto per il numero di conto %(nr)s viene importato in un "
"processo in background."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The total items (%(total)s) cannot absorb the amount to move (%(needed)s): "
"the total must have the same sign and be larger than the amount of the moved"
" items."
msgstr ""
"Le righe del totale (%(total)s) non possono assorbire l'importo da spostare "
"(%(needed)s): il totale deve avere lo stesso segno ed essere maggiore "
"dell'importo delle righe spostate."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "This entry has been created by splitting %s."
msgstr "Questo movimento è stato creato dividendo %s."

#. module: account_switzerland
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_switzerland/wizards/account_move_split_wizard.py:0
msgid "This entry has been split. The moved journal items are now in %s."
msgstr ""
"Questo movimento è stato diviso. Le righe spostate si trovano ora in %s."

#. module: account_switzerland
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:account_switzerland.selection__account_move_split_wizard_line__action__total
msgid "Total (adapt and split)"
msgstr "Totale (adatta e dividi)"

